WEBVTT

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:00.976
Va hattoki ojiz go’daklar ham

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:03.389
inson tovushiga jilmayishadi.

00:02:04.381 --> 00:02:06.976
Tabassum barcha insonlarning eng 
sodda, biologik qaror

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:09.437
topuvchi yuz ifodalaridan biri sanaladi.

00:02:09.461 --> 00:02:11.525
Papua Yangi Gvineyada o’tkazilgan

00:02:11.549 --> 00:02:15.820
tadqiqotlarda, Paul Ekman, yuz 
ifodalarida sayyoramizning eng atoqli

00:02:15.844 --> 00:02:18.976
tadqiqotchisi hatto G’arb dunyosidan

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:22.172
butunlay uzilib qolgan va yana 
noodatiy kannibalizm

00:02:22.196 --> 00:02:25.459
udumlariga amal qiluvchi For qabilasi ham

00:02:25.483 --> 00:02:26.767
(Kulgu)

00:02:26.791 --> 00:02:29.434
bir xil vaziyatni xuddi siz va bizdek

00:02:29.458 --> 00:02:31.402
tabassumga yo’yganlar.